# React Native Navigation — Expo Router

- Expo Router is required for Expo apps.
- Route files live under `app/`; route files stay thin and compose named components.
- `_layout.tsx` owns stack/tab/drawer structure and providers.
- Enable typed routes and use absolute hrefs.
- Route files may default-export; reusable modules use named exports.
- Validate `useLocalSearchParams` output with zod before use.
- Deep links/native intents are untrusted input.
- Route params contain ids/filters, not full server entities.
